## Brand Assets Notice (`assets/brand/`)

The MIT License above applies to all source code (`index.html`, `styles/`,
`src/`, `server.mjs`) and the sample holiday images under `assets/bg/` and
`assets/photos/`.

The brand wordmark under `assets/brand/` (`simplemkt-wordmark-reverse.png`)
is a proprietary brand asset of SimpleMkt, included solely for live
demonstration and attribution in the original release. If you fork,
redistribute, or deploy this project for your own product or brand, please
replace the files in `assets/brand/` (and `BRAND_CONFIG` in `src/config.js`
plus the corresponding page title) with your own brand assets.

